"file_md5": "6d6cb5e75f1eddc12a6012c4d5c87605", "business_type": "medical_case", "business_id": "41", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260412/776E1FE4-22B1-41E9-9FEE-2A869E728B49/photo_E8CDBDED-74EF-48B4-9393-FA5F757B78B7.jpg", "storage_type": "oss", "created_at": "2026-04-12T12:28:07.462859Z", "file_url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260412/776E1FE4-22B1-41E9-9FEE-2A869E728B49/photo_E8CDBDED-74EF-48B4-9393-FA5F757B78B7.jpg"}]}, {"id": 37, "member": 16, "record_type": "custom", "status": 1, "title": "就诊病例", "hospital_name": "苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）", "age_at_visit": 28, "diagnosis_summary": "患者赵道凯，男，1998年10月29日出生，2026年2月6日于苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）口腔科门诊初诊，主诉要求口腔检查1天，现病史为今日来诊要求口腔检查，既往史无慢性疾病史，过敏史无，专科检查见38/48近中低位阻生，远中牙龈覆盖，龈红肿，诊断为阻生牙，建议择期拔除阻生牙；2026年2月10日于苏州大学附属第四医院行无痛电子胃镜检查，内镜所见食管通过顺利、黏膜大致正常，贲门开合通畅，胃底黏膜正常，胃体见胆汁残留，胃角光整，胃窦黏膜红白相间以红为主，幽门圆、开放好，十二指肠球部及所见降部未见明显异常，诊断为慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流。\n\n阻生牙；慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流", "extra": {"source": "typed_upload", "occurred_at": "2026-02-06"}, "created_at": "2026-04-12T10:27:41.963334Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-12T10:27:41.963346Z", "symptoms": ["口腔检查要求"], "medications": [], "attachments": [{"id": 151, "file_uuid": "7ec2265c-c82b-4a88-9564-830b154f4f3e", "original_name": "photo_9B421E8D-0FE6-407F-98B2-B53CFD1D3A3F.jpg", "file_size": 273201, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749", "business_type": "medical_case", "business_id": "37", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260412/7EC2265C-C82B-4A88-9564-830B154F4F3E/photo_9B421E8D-0FE6-407F-98B2-B53CFD1D3A3F.jpg", "storage_type": "oss", "created_at": "2026-04-12T10:26:36.546026Z", "file_url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260412/7EC2265C-C82B-4A88-9564-830B154F4F3E/photo_9B421E8D-0FE6-407F-98B2-B53CFD1D3A3F.jpg"}, {"id": 150, "file_uuid": "5b767615-0755-4757-9034-bd7c9fd78900", "original_name": "photo_DFE8DA9B-BA6F-41BA-9153-F0FC98CCC259.jpg", "file_size": 190624, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "6d6cb5e75f1eddc12a6012c